Description: Abseil crc_cord_state library
URL: https://abseil.io/
Version: 20260817
Requires: absl_crc32c = 20260817, absl_config = 20260817, absl_strings = 20260817, absl_no_destructor = 20260817
Libs: -L${libdir}  -labsl_crc_cord_state 
Cflags: -I${includedir} -DNOMINMAX
